From: Ken Hoven <ken.hoven@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 22:30:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] content: real author bio, pillar-aware lead magnet, trim long
 SEO titles

- Author bio now reflects Ken's actual background (20+ years industrial
  plant management / vendor-quote scrutiny) instead of the generic
  "homeowner, 15+ years DIY repairs" placeholder. Single source of truth
  (src/content/authors/ken-hoven.ts) updates it site-wide.
- NewsletterBlock is now pillar-aware: home-inspection-repairs articles
  and the pillar hub now pitch the Inspection Repair Negotiation
  Checklist instead of the generic Cost Calendar, matching what the
  reader just read. Still no email required for either PDF; email
  capture stays opt-in via the existing Beehiiv-backed subscribe form.
- Shortened 12 of the 19 page titles over 65 characters (Google's rough
  SERP truncation point) across advice/costs/tools pages, keeping the
  primary keyword phrase first. Verified via a meta-audit script against
  the full static build: 0 missing titles, 0 duplicate titles/descriptions,
  long titles down from 19 to 5.

Verified: npm run build, npm run lint, and
scripts/check-rendered-text.mjs (927/927 pages clean) all pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
